-- ZOKY: open ordering to all of Thailand (Founder 2026-11-02: "เปิดใช้ทั่วประเทศไทย").
--
-- Data-only change. WYN-211 (migrations_wynos_food_service_area_v1.sql) checks
-- every quote, order, store readiness and the area-check RPC through
-- internal.food_in_service_area, which accepts a point inside ANY active row
-- of public.food_service_areas. This adds one active row covering Thailand;
-- no function, policy or grant changes. The Maha Sarakham row stays as it is.
--
-- Boundary: OpenStreetMap relation 2067731 (Thailand, including territorial
-- waters, so islands such as Ko Tao, Ko Lipe and Ko Phi Phi are inside),
-- (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL. Outer ring only, Douglas-Peucker
-- 0.003 degrees (about 330 m), 2695 points. Per-store delivery radius and
-- fees are unchanged, so each store still only delivers near itself.
--
-- Rollback (re-runnable): supabase/rollbacks/20261102140000_zoky_service_area_thailand_rollback.sql
-- sets this row inactive, which restores Maha Sarakham-only ordering.

